going to hell and back with dog/cat has nothing to do with it! you have
to admit that dogs and cats are not symmetrical. in nethack, cats do
things traditionally associated with dogs. i guess anything is possible
but despite claims to the contrary i am unconvinced that you could ever
"train" a cat to do anything useful on command, consistently. i think
that cats and dogs, in nethack, should not have symmetric behaviors which
isn't to say that cats shouldn't be useful. cats should not be dogs. i
think there should be a snow leopard and a hell cat to match the winter
wolf and hell hound. cats shouldn't be so good at carrying things like
dogs are. perhaps cats should always respect curses unlike dogs and i
would think that cats would be able to detect hidden doors and traps
much better than dogs. of course, what do you do with other monster-type
pets???

although arguments can be made that your pet is like your starting
inventory and is therefore not choosable, i don't find it unreasonable
to want to be a wizard with a pet dog.

